WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.095 --> 00:00:15.896
balloon animals started smashing windows and chasing people.

2
00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:19.877
The clowns laughed and ran off.

3
00:00:22.658 --> 00:00:26.079
Crash! A balloon lion knocked over a hot dog stand.

4
00:00:26.099 --> 00:00:28.200
"My hot dogs!"

5
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.120
the owner cried.

6
00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:32.312
"Rocket Girl, help!"

7
00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:32.872
a woman cried.

8
00:00:33.973 --> 00:00:36.033
A balloon tiger snapped its jaws at her.

9
00:00:37.854 --> 00:00:39.554
Roxy shot toward the balloon tiger.

10
00:00:40.475 --> 00:00:42.355
The tiger spun around and faced her.

11
00:00:44.356 --> 00:00:46.156
Roxy grabbed it and held it on the ground.

12
00:00:48.457 --> 00:00:50.958
The tiger wriggled free and then rolled on top of her.

13
00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:55.579
"Grr!" Roxy struggled with the big balloon.

14
00:00:56.939 --> 00:00:58.420
She squeezed as hard as she could.

15
00:01:00.652 --> 00:01:03.274
Pop! The balloon tiger zipped back and forth as the air left it.

16
00:01:03.994 --> 00:01:06.155
Soon the lifeless balloon fell to the street.

17
00:01:07.476 --> 00:01:09.677
Roxy quickly popped all the other balloon animals.

18
00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:12.559
Then she went after the clowns.

19
00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:15.981
Terrell, Jack, and Mara were in science.

20
00:01:17.462 --> 00:01:18.703
Terrell pointed out the window.

21
00:01:18.723 --> 00:01:20.864
"I see clowns!"

22
00:01:24.406 --> 00:01:25.487
Mara scratched her head.

23
00:01:25.507 --> 00:01:27.668
"Why are they jogging?"

24
00:01:29.716 --> 00:01:31.016
Mr. Bubbles stopped jogging.

25
00:01:31.036 --> 00:01:34.037
"Take a break, boys," he said.

26
00:01:34.057 --> 00:01:38.198
"I need to catch my breath."

27
00:01:39.419 --> 00:01:40.699
The other clowns fell over.

28
00:01:40.719 --> 00:01:44.940
"I can't run anymore, boss," one said.

29
00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:47.741
"My legs are tired!"

30
00:01:47.761 --> 00:01:51.602
"It's too bad we left the car," another said.

31
00:01:52.882 --> 00:01:53.903
Mr. Bubbles nodded.

32
00:01:53.923 --> 00:01:56.763
"This escape isn't going well."

33
00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.224
"There you are!"

34
00:01:59.188 --> 00:02:00.769
Roxy swooped down toward the clowns.

35
00:02:00.789 --> 00:02:02.650
"Quick, boys!"

36
00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:03.831
Mr. Bubbles cried.

37
00:02:03.851 --> 00:02:07.433
"Run!" The other clowns tried to move.

38
00:02:08.153 --> 00:02:10.094
But police officers arrived and surrounded them.

39
00:02:11.615 --> 00:02:13.136
Roxy didn't see Detective Smith.

40
00:02:13.156 --> 00:02:15.958
"I guess he's still afraid of clowns."

41
00:02:17.038 --> 00:02:17.779
She grabbed Mr.

42
00:02:17.799 --> 00:02:18.379
Bubbles' arm.

43
00:02:18.399 --> 00:02:20.500
"You're going back to prison!"

44
00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:21.201
she said.

45
00:02:22.181 --> 00:02:24.463
Mr. Bubbles pulled a rubber chicken from his pocket.

46
00:02:24.483 --> 00:02:29.917
"Grow!" The rubber chicken grew fast.

47
00:02:32.659 --> 00:02:33.780
Cluck, cluck!

48
00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:36.102
The giant rubber chicken pecked at Roxy.

49
00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:42.226
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted it into little pieces.

50
00:02:43.087 --> 00:02:44.027
Terrell looked around.

51
00:02:44.047 --> 00:02:48.231
"Roxy is never around when Rocket Girl shows up," he thought.

52
00:02:50.912 --> 00:02:53.194
Mr. Bubbles squeezed the flower on his jacket.

53
00:02:54.675 --> 00:02:55.496
Smoke poured out.

54
00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.821
Roxy felt the clown slip from her hand.

55
00:02:58.842 --> 00:03:00.383
"Where did he go?"

56
00:03:00.763 --> 00:03:01.964
Roxy couldn't see anything.

57
00:03:03.385 --> 00:03:04.145
She heard a click.

58
00:03:05.566 --> 00:03:07.868
Roxy used her super breath to blow away the smoke.

59
00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.591
Detective Smith stood next to Mr.

60
00:03:11.631 --> 00:03:13.852
Bubbles. The clown was in handcuffs.

61
00:03:13.872 --> 00:03:15.434
"You came!"

62
00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:16.414
Roxy said.

63
00:03:17.295 --> 00:03:18.436
Detective Smith nodded.

64
00:03:18.456 --> 00:03:22.018
"I decided to face my fear, just like you said.

65
00:03:22.419 --> 00:03:23.500
Thanks, Rocket Girl."

66
00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.281
Roxy walked into school.

67
00:03:31.102 --> 00:03:33.023
"You missed the clowns, Roxy!"

68
00:03:33.343 --> 00:03:33.904
Jack said.

69
00:03:33.924 --> 00:03:36.685
"And a giant rubber chicken!"

70
00:03:37.065 --> 00:03:37.686
Mara said.

71
00:03:37.706 --> 00:03:40.807
"Really?" Roxy pretended to be surprised.

72
00:03:41.828 --> 00:03:43.589
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

73
00:03:43.609 --> 00:03:47.251
"You also missed Rocket Girl—again."

74
00:03:48.551 --> 00:03:49.532
Roxy just shrugged.
